# zirda-takes-two-off-an-ability-you-activate.) Bot1 casts it on turn 1 with three Moxen. Bot2's The Wondrous Wasp strips it on turn 2,
# and on turn 3 Inventors' Fair's {4} search, which three Moxen cannot pay for alone, is not offered.

